a-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:rotate(0);transition:transform 0.2s\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div style=\"position:relative\"><button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:#1a1a2e;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\">Levels<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:rotate(0);transition:transform 0.2s\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div style=\"position:relative\"><button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:#1a1a2e;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\">Coverage<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:rotate(0);transition:transform 0.2s\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem\" class=\"hidden-mobile\"><a style=\"padding:0.5rem 1rem;color:#1a1a2e;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\" href=\"/login\">Log in</a><a style=\"padding:0.5rem 1.25rem;background-color:#2563eb;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;border-radius:0.5rem\" href=\"/register\">Sign Up</a></div><button style=\"background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;display:none\" class=\"show-mobile\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div><style>\n        @media (max-width: 768px) { .hidden-mobile { display: none !important; } .show-mobile { display: block !important; } }\n        @media (min-width: 769px) { .show-mobile { display: none !important; } }\n      </style></nav><main><div style=\"background-color:white\"><section style=\"background-color:#1a1a2e;padding:5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center\"><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);font-weight:800;color:white;margin-bottom:1rem\">Levels We Cover</h1><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:1.05rem;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto\">From primary school to university — find the right tutor for every stage of learning.</p></section><section style=\"padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-color:#f9fafb\"><div style=\"max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap:1.5rem\"><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background-color:#eff6ff;border-radius:0.625rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem\">Primary School</h3><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:0.75rem\">Grade 1–5<!-- --> · <!-- -->Ages 5–10</p></div></div><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">Foundation subjects including English, Urdu, Mathematics, Science, and Islamiyat.</p><a style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#eff6ff;color:#2563eb;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:0.4rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/tutors?level=Primary School\">Find Tutors →</a></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background-color:#f0fdf4;border-radius:0.625rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem\">Middle School</h3><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:0.75rem\">Grade 6–8<!-- --> · <!-- -->Ages 11–13</p></div></div><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">Core subjects with increasing complexity. Science, Math, Languages, and Social Studies.</p><a style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:0.4rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/tutors?level=Middle School\">Find Tutors →</a></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background-color:#fffbeb;border-radius:0.625rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem\">Matriculation</h3><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:0.75rem\">Grade 9–10<!-- --> · <!-- -->Ages 14–15</p></div></div><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">Board exam preparation for all Pakistani education boards (Punjab, Federal, Sindh, KPK).</p><a style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#fffbeb;color:#d97706;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:0.4rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/tutors?level=Matriculation\">Find Tutors →</a></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background-color:#fdf4ff;border-radius:0.625rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem\">O-Levels</h3><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:0.75rem\">Cambridge IGCSE<!-- --> · <!-- -->Ages 14–16</p></div></div><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">Cambridge O-Level preparation across all subjects including Pure Math, Sciences, and Languages.</p><a style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#fdf4ff;color:#7c3aed;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:0.4rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/tutors?level=O-Levels\">Find Tutors →</a></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background-color:#fff1f2;border-radius:0.625rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e94560\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem\">Intermediate / FSc</h3><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:0.75rem\">Grade 11–12<!-- --> · <!-- -->Ages 16–17</p></div></div><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">Pre-medical, Pre-engineering, ICS, and FA preparation for all boards.</p><a style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#fff1f2;color:#e94560;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:0.4rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/tutors?level=Intermediate / FSc\">Find Tutors →</a></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background-color:#eff6ff;border-radius:0.625rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem\">A-Levels</h3><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:0.75rem\">Cambridge AS &amp; A2<!-- --> · <!-- -->Ages 16–18</p></div></div><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">Advanced Cambridge A-Level preparation for university entrance.</p><a style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#eff6ff;color:#2563eb;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:0.4rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/tutors?level=A-Levels\">Find Tutors →</a></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background-color:#f0fdf4;border-radius:0.625rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem\">University Level</h3><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:0.75rem\">Bachelor&#x27;s / Master&#x27;s<!-- --> · <!-- -->Ages 18+</p></div></div><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">University-level tutoring for engineering, medicine, business, CS, and more.</p><a style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:0.4rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/tutors?level=University Level\">Find Tutors →</a></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background-color:#fffbeb;border-radius:0.625rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem\">Test Preparation</h3><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:0.75rem\">Entry Tests<!-- --> · <!-- -->All Ages</p></div></div><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">MDCAT, ECAT, NTS, IELTS, SAT, and other competitive exam preparation.</p><a style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#fffbeb;color:#d97706;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:0.4rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/tutors?level=Test Preparation\">Find Tutors →</a></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer style=\"background-color:#1a1